raco fhirpath ’<expr>’ resource.json  one result per line (R5; --r4 for R4)
raco fhirpath ’<expr>’                no resource: over the empty collection
raco fhirpath –tck [r5|r4]            the HL7 FHIRPath suite, floor-ratcheted
raco fhirpath –ucum-tck [-v]          the UCUM functional tests
